2. Cutout refinement (SAM)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Name:     EdgeSAM
  Authors:  Chong Zhou et al. (S-Lab, Nanyang Technological University)
  Upstream: https://github.com/chongzhou96/EdgeSAM
  Licence:  Apache License 2.0

  Bundled artifacts:
    sam_encoder_edgesam_v2.tflite
      RepViT image encoder (edge_sam_3x ONNX export), input NHWC, output
      embedding [1,256,64,64], fp16 weights. Made to run in fp16 (NPU):
      constant scales folded into the convolutions feeding the neck
      LayerNorms and into the squeeze-excitation means (1/1024, 1/64; exact
      in fp32), Erf replaced by the tanh approximation of GELU on clipped
      input (max error 3.6e-4), converted with onnx2tf and the TensorFlow
      converter.
    sam_decoder_edgesam.tflite   box-prompted mask decoder, fp32 TFLite export.

