3. Panel detection
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Name:     panel_detector_v2 (Komikku)
  Base:     YOLOX-nano, Megvii (https://github.com/Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX),
            COCO-pretrained weights
  Licence:  Apache License 2.0

  Single-class ("panel") detector fine-tuned for Komikku on comic, manga and
  bande-dessinée pages. Training labels were the panel boxes on which several
  automatic sources agreed (other panel detectors and a gutter heuristic,
  plus, for v2, the v1 model as an extra voter); no third-party model weights
  are included.

  Bundled artifact:
    panel_detector_v2.tflite
      Input [1,640,640,3] BGR 0..255, page letterboxed at the top-left with
      grey 114; output [1,8400,6] decoded boxes (cx, cy, w, h, objectness,
      class). Exported to ONNX (opset 17, static shape), converted with
      onnx2tf, fp16 weights.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

All bundled artifacts are derivative works of their respective source models,
redistributed under the same licence as their source. For sections 1 and 2 no
changes were made to trained weights beyond quantization / format conversion
for on-device inference, and none to the model architecture beyond the
conversion steps listed above. The section 3 model was trained (fine-tuned)
for Komikku as described there.
